    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "His earlier bail application was dismissed as withdrawn.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1011,
      "end": 1067,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2856166660785675
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2. It is the submission of learned counsel for the applicant that false case has been registered against him and he is suffering confinement since 17-03-2024 and charge-sheet has already been filed,\ntherefore, chance of tampering with evidence is remote.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1069,
      "end": 1323,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "17-03-2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1216,
          "end": 1226
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22214652597904205
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "It is further submitted that false case has been registered against him and he took loan from the Bank over the legitimate property kept as mortgage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1324,
      "end": 1473,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30816951394081116
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Therefore, no case for implication is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1474,
      "end": 1521,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3225559592247009
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "It was civil transaction wherein loan has been taken from the Bank.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1522,
      "end": 1589,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40729227662086487
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "If any default is being committed then that can be recovered from him as borrower as per law.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1590,
      "end": 1683,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3521876931190491
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Thus, prayed for grant of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1684,
      "end": 1715,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30226486921310425
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the respondent/State opposed the prayer and submitted that the case is of year 2020 and applicant is absconding for four years.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1716,
      "end": 1867,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2693636417388916
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Applicant is facing wrath of other criminal Nasir Husain vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 12 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/76860926/\n1 cases likewise Crime No.135/2015 for offence under Sections 420, 465, 467, 468, 471, 201, 34 of IPC and another case in respect of Section 354-A, 294, 506 of IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1868,
      "end": 2191,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Nasir Husain vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
