        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3413604497909546
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Besides other cases, allegations are serious in nature because he mortgaged the property on the basis of rent note of Ms. Survey whereas Ms. Survey never executed any rent note in favour of present applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2192,
      "end": 2400,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Survey",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 2314,
          "end": 2320
        },
        {
          "text": "Survey",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 2333,
          "end": 2339
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1740056723356247
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Even in mortgage deed (Bandhak Patra) false information has been provided.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2401,
      "end": 2475,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bandhak Patra",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2424,
          "end": 2437
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11664523184299469
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the Bank also objected the bail application of the applicant and Shri Brijesh Sharma appeared on behalf of Bank submits that earlier also applicant committed fraud.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2476,
      "end": 2664,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Brijesh Sharma",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 2570,
          "end": 2584
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12665745615959167
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "This time also he took loan for business purpose for his firm M/s Millennium Marble in which he placed co-accused as Guarantor and place of business was referred as Ramdas Ghati, Jail Road, Lashkar district Gwalior whereas in bank, place is referred as property of Smt. Pushpmala Survey wife of late Tatyarao alias Mallarao Survey.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2665,
      "end": 2996,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Millennium Marble",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2731,
          "end": 2748
        },
        {
          "text": "Lashkar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2855,
          "end": 2862
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2872,
          "end": 2879
        },
        {
          "text": "Pushpmala Survey",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2935,
          "end": 2951
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatyarao alias Mallarao Survey",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2965,
          "end": 2995
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07003838568925858
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Said rent note was never executed by the said lady, still rent note was prepared and placed before Bank for this purpose.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2997,
      "end": 3118,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17507915198802948
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "When bank visited over the mortgaged property then Bank found that one Uma Soni was residing in the said house and she informed the Bank that said house has been purchased 5 years back by her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3119,
      "end": 3311,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Uma Soni",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3190,
          "end": 3198
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17035062611103058
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "In short he prepared forged documents to get loan and then evaded the liability.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3312,
      "end": 3392,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18908995389938354
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel for the other complainant Shri D.S. Tomar on behalf of victim Gayatri Survey opposed the submissions and submitted that looking to the contents of charge-sheet, it appears that applicant is mischievous and his bail application be rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3394,
      "end": 3652,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "D.S. Tomar",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 3444,
          "end": 3454
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10683811455965042
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Applicant forged the rent note of mother of Ms. Gayatri Survey.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3653,
      "end": 3716,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gayatri Survey",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 3701,
          "end": 3715
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23394325375556946
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "6. Heard learned counsel for the parties at length and perused the case diary.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3718,
      "end": 3799,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10071897506713867
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "From perusal of case diary and nature of allegations against the applicant, it appears that allegations are serious in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3800,
      "end": 3926,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15326374769210815
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Applicant along with one Mahendra Pratap earlier also committed same nature of offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3927,
      "end": 4014,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mahendra Pratap",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3952,
          "end": 3967
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18044964969158173
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "This time applicant took loan from M.P. State Cooperative Bank in which Mahendra Pratap stood as Guarantor and referred the address at Kampoo, Lashkar District Gwalior.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4015,
      "end": 4183,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "M.P. State Cooperative Bank",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 4050,
          "end": 4077
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahendra Pratap",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4087,
          "end": 4102
        },
        {
          "text": "Kampoo",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4150,
          "end": 4156
        },
        {
          "text": "Lashkar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4158,
          "end": 4165
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4175,
          "end": 4182
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1831367313861847
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "When the applicant committed default, the Bank went to the place where they found that rent note executed was forged and therefore, it appears that no firm was working on the place which was mentioned in the Bank.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4184,
      "end": 4398,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23744168877601624
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "All these facts were referred just to get loan.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4399,
      "end": 4446,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17214708030223846
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "When the Bank visited the place which was mortgaged by the co-accused Mahendra Pratap then one Uma Soni was found to be in possession of the said premises.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4447,
      "end": 4602,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mahendra Pratap",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4517,
          "end": 4532
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma Soni",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4542,
          "end": 4550
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2063107043504715
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "8. In the permanent registration certificate of shop, address is Ramdas Ghati, Jail Road, Lashkar Gwalior whereas for loan purpose address at Kampoo, Lashkar Gwalior has been mentioned and that too with forged rent note.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4604,
      "end": 4824,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Lashkar Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4694,
          "end": 4709
        },
        {
          "text": "Kampoo",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4746,
          "end": 4752
        },
        {
          "text": "Lashkar Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4754,
          "end": 4769
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07525864243507385
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "From the statements of Branch Manager, Pushpmala Raje Survey and Arun Rao (one of the witness of the alleged agreement) it transpires that the applicant by preparing forged rent note took loan from the Bank.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4825,
      "end": 5032,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pushpmala Raje Survey",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 4864,
          "end": 4885
        },
        {
          "text": "Arun Rao",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 4890,
          "end": 4898
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22907452285289764
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Arun Rao (witness of the alleged agreement) categorically denied his signature over the said agreement.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 5033,
      "end": 5136,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Arun Rao",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 5033,
          "end": 5041
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3693434000015259
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "9. Looking to the nature of allegations and criminal record which applicant bears, this Court is of the considered view that no case for grant of bail is made out in favour of applicant, at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 5137,
      "end": 5339,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33159416913986206
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Application sans merits and is hereby dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5340,
      "end": 5389,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07808758318424225
